<p><br /></p>

<h3 id="method-2-qr-code-scan">Method 2: QR-code scan</h3>

<ol>
  <li>
    <p>Open the smartphone camera or any QR app.</p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <p>Scan the code adjacent to the City &amp; Guilds crest.</p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <p>Auto-redirect to the same secure MyCertis record.</p>
  </li>
</ol>

<p>Works offline: the QR stores an embedded URL that loads once a connection resumes.</p>

